runs/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
# interrupted downloads
*.part
# archives of data/, pretrained/, runs/ for sharing (300-400 MB each, over GitHub's 100 MB file limit)
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tar.xz
*.zip

